{"id":16557,"date":"2023-09-01T09:23:44","date_gmt":"2023-09-01T15:23:44","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/?post_type=news&#038;p=16557"},"modified":"2025-04-29T19:29:57","modified_gmt":"2025-04-29T23:29:57","slug":"newsletter-sep-2023-vol-9-23","status":"publish","type":"news","link":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/news-events\/newsletter-sep-2023-vol-9-23\/","title":{"rendered":"Newsletter: Sep 2023 (Vol 9.23)"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"16557\" class=\"elementor elementor-16557\" data-elementor-post-type=\"news\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-3f980c2 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"3f980c2\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-dab8878\" data-id=\"dab8878\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d7ec286 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d7ec286\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We are gearing up for a busy fall conference season! We hope to see you on the road. Check out our updated <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/news-events\/\">News &amp; Events page<\/a> for a list of where we&#8217;ll be!<\/p><h2>Supporting our Partners in Hawaii<\/h2><p>We know that many of our partners, their clients, families, and loved ones have been affected by the recent wildfires in Maui. While we can&#8217;t be on the ground volunteering, we would still like to show our support in other ways.<\/p><p>If you feel inclined to contribute, below are 2 options:<\/p><ul><li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.mauiunitedway.org\/reliefinfo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Maui United Way<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.hawaiicommunityfoundation.org\/maui-strong\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Maui Strong &#8211; Hawaii Community Foundation<\/a><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-d8eb853 elementor-reverse-mobile elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"d8eb853\" data-element_type=\"section\" id=\"employeeSpotlight\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-5e09642\" data-id=\"5e09642\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b082186 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b082186\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/gareth-bentley-customer-support-coordinator-rethinkbh.jpg\" alt=\"Gareth Bentley, Customer Support Coordinator for RethinkBH\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" \/><\/p><h2 style=\"margin: 0px; color: #ffffff;\">Employee Spotlight<\/h2><h3 style=\"margin-top: 15px; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold;\">Gareth Bentley,<em> Customer Support Coordinator<\/em><\/h3><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>Lives in:<\/strong> Waynesboro, VA<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>Children:<\/strong> 1 daughter<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>Favorite food:<\/strong> Authentic Jamaican cuisine<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>Favorite movie(s):<\/strong> Bad Boys 2 and The Breakfast Club<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>If you could have any superpower, what would it be?<\/strong> To create anything out of nothing because there are less fortunate people in need and there&#8217;s impact to create<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d182c47 vertical-align-middle elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d182c47\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full alignleft\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/apple.png\" alt=\"purple apple icon\"  width=\"125\" height=\"auto\" \/>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left: 20px;\">August 2023 Events<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-c3fd4fd elementor-section-content-middle elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"c3fd4fd\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-6074416\" data-id=\"6074416\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7d95d5b elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"7d95d5b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/portia-james-founder-ceo-behavior-genius.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-15545\" alt=\"Portia James, Founder &amp; CEO of Behavior Genius\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/portia-james-founder-ceo-behavior-genius.jpg 600w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/portia-james-founder-ceo-behavior-genius-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/portia-james-founder-ceo-behavior-genius-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-08dca02\" data-id=\"08dca02\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-908e27c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"908e27c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Practice Spotlight: Behavior Genius<\/h3><p><strong>Thurs, Sept 7th @ 1 pm ET<\/strong><\/p><p>Portia James is back and this time she joins the Rethink ABA Start-up Community to discuss her journey as a BCBA entrepreneur, her emphasis on <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/making-case-for-diversity-aba\/\">diversity<\/a> and <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/cultural-humility-from-clinical-practices-to-parent-training\/\">cultural awareness<\/a> in ABA, and her passion for helping other minority behavior analysts be successful in the field. Don&#8217;t miss this incredible speaker!<\/p><p><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/get.rethinkbh.com\/suc-custspotpj-09-07\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Save your spot today! <\/a><\/strong><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-4aa346a elementor-reverse-mobile elementor-section-content-middle elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"4aa346a\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-01ac07b\" data-id=\"01ac07b\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cdd3d50 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"cdd3d50\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Assessing and Teaching Job-Related Social Skills: Maximizing Success of Neurodiverse Employees<\/h3><p><strong>Thurs, Sept 21st @ 1 pm ET<\/strong><\/p><p>Dr. Dorothea Lerman joins Dr. Bridget Taylor on Our Next Guest to discuss challenges with job-related skills and behavior analytic tools to boost success for neurodiverse individuals.<\/p><p>This webinar is eligible for 1 free CE so <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/assessing-and-teaching-job-related-social-skills-maximizing-success-of-neurodiverse-employees\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>register today to claim your spot!<\/strong><\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-47d07f1\" data-id=\"47d07f1\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-becbd86 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"becbd86\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/dr-dorothea-lerman-rethinkbh-webinar.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-16600\" alt=\"Headshot of Dr. Dorothea Lerman\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/dr-dorothea-lerman-rethinkbh-webinar.jpg 600w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/dr-dorothea-lerman-rethinkbh-webinar-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/dr-dorothea-lerman-rethinkbh-webinar-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-20ce13a elementor-section-content-middle elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"20ce13a\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-51997d1\" data-id=\"51997d1\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b1fc838 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"b1fc838\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1200\" height=\"800\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/meet-us-at-faba-2023-rethinkbh.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-16361\" alt=\"Meet us at FABA 2023\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/meet-us-at-faba-2023-rethinkbh.jpg 1200w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/meet-us-at-faba-2023-rethinkbh-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/meet-us-at-faba-2023-rethinkbh-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/meet-us-at-faba-2023-rethinkbh-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-4c8d455\" data-id=\"4c8d455\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d5f3925 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d5f3925\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Florida Association for Behavior Analysis<\/h3><p><strong>Sept 27th &#8211; 30th<\/strong><\/p><p>Rethink will be exhibiting at the FABA conference in Orlando, FL! Come by our booth to learn more about the NEW Analytics module coming this year, the Rethink Start-up Community, ask us questions and get support, or just say hi to our team!<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-aa8d3f0 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"aa8d3f0\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-92a31fe\" data-id=\"92a31fe\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-68d0dea elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"68d0dea\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Features You Don&#8217;t Want to Miss!<\/h2><p>Did you know about the following features available on the Rethink platform? If not, use the links below to guide you and improve your experience!<\/p><h3>Clinical Features<\/h3><p><a href=\"https:\/\/rethinkautism.atlassian.net\/wiki\/spaces\/RBS\/pages\/3572006913\/Discontinued+Program+Tab+in+the+Client+Program\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Discontinued Programs<\/a> tab for Client Programs. Discontinued program data is visible in Analyze Data and can be included on Funder Reports but do not show in Data Entry or the mobile app.<\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/rethinkautism.atlassian.net\/wiki\/spaces\/RBS\/pages\/3572662273\/Behavior+Support+Goals+Tracking+Weekly+and+Monthly\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Track mastery criteria by week or month<\/a> for behavior support goals.<\/p><h3>Submit Your Ideas!<\/h3><p>Use <a href=\"https:\/\/rethinkautism.atlassian.net\/wiki\/spaces\/RBS\/pages\/3572433049\/Rethink+BH+Ideas+Portal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Rethink&#8217;s Ideas Portal<\/a> to submit requests to our product team to consider and upvote other users&#8217; requests.<\/p><h3>Mobile App<\/h3><p>Toggle to control whether cancelled appointments are visible or hidden on the calendar.<\/p><h3>Reporting Dashboard<\/h3><p>Create and schedule <a href=\"https:\/\/rethinkautism.atlassian.net\/wiki\/spaces\/RBS\/pages\/3605135361\/Create+and+Manage+Payroll+Export+Subscriptions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Payroll Export Subscriptions<\/a><\/p><p>Export list of <a href=\"https:\/\/rethinkautism.atlassian.net\/wiki\/spaces\/RBS\/pages\/3572432897\/Staff+General+Attributes+Report+Tutorial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Staff General Attributes<\/a> and <a href=\"https:\/\/rethinkautism.atlassian.net\/wiki\/spaces\/RBS\/pages\/3572432966\/Client+Demographics+Report+Tutorial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Client Demographics<\/a><\/p><h3>Parent Access<\/h3><p>Ability to view a <a href=\"https:\/\/rethinkautism.atlassian.net\/wiki\/spaces\/RBS\/pages\/3614081025\/Client+Contact+Registration+Verification+Code+Expired+Label\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Client Contact&#8217;s registration status<\/a>, registration sent date, and resend verification codes if needed.\u00a0<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><strong><a href